{"user": "what is the best strategy to use?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T17:18:31.485667+00:00", "assistant": "At this board, there\u2019s **no strategy left**: the board is full and Black has **no legal moves**, so the game is over.\n\nBest endgame strategy for next time:\n\n- **Corners first** \u2014 they can\u2019t be flipped.\n- **Avoid squares next to empty corners** unless you\u2019ve checked they don\u2019t give White the corner.\n- **Don\u2019t chase biggest flip**; a big flip now can give opponent the last good moves.\n- **Limit White\u2019s legal moves** \u2014 if they must pass, you often gain control.\n- **Count the final sequence**: ask \u201cafter my move, what can White do, and who gets the last squares?\u201d", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T17:18:39.618600+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T17:18:42.178848+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "General Principle"]